{"bendscript":"0.1","blocks":[{"id":"blk-2099","kind":"heading","level":1,"spans":[{"id":"spn-2133","text":"The Compose Runtime — CC2 "},{"id":"spn-2134","marks":["code"],"text":"compose"},{"id":"spn-2135","text":", made authorable (design note)"}]},{"id":"blk-2100","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-2136","marks":["bold"],"text":"Status:"},{"id":"spn-2137","text":" design proposal · "},{"id":"spn-2138","marks":["bold"],"text":"Reviewable against:"},{"id":"spn-2139","text":" "},{"id":"spn-2140","marks":["code"],"text":"CC2-capability-composition.md"},{"id":"spn-2141","text":" (§2 operators, §3 coalition), "},{"id":"spn-2142","marks":["code"],"text":"UMBRELLA.md"},{"id":"spn-2143","text":" (the "},{"id":"spn-2144","marks":["code"],"text":"compose"},{"id":"spn-2145","text":" stage), "},{"id":"spn-2146","marks":["code"],"text":"box-and-box"},{"id":"spn-2147","text":" (8 rungs / 103 laws) · "},{"id":"spn-2148","marks":["bold"],"text":"Surface home:"},{"id":"spn-2149","text":" "},{"id":"spn-2150","marks":["code"],"text":"weave/forge.html"},{"id":"spn-2151","text":" (the lego canvas) · "},{"id":"spn-2152","marks":["bold"],"text":"Runtime home:"},{"id":"spn-2153","text":" "},{"id":"spn-2154","marks":["code"],"text":"AmpersandBoxDesign/box-and-box/"},{"id":"spn-2155","text":" (new "},{"id":"spn-2156","marks":["code"],"text":"compose.mjs"},{"id":"spn-2157","text":")"}]},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-2102","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-2158","text":"One line: turn the "},{"id":"spn-2159","marks":["bold"],"text":"one unfinished stage of the [&] pipeline"},{"id":"spn-2160","text":" — "},{"id":"spn-2161","marks":["code"],"text":"compose"},{"id":"spn-2162","text":" (lawless "},{"id":"spn-2163","marks":["code"],"text":"|>"},{"id":"spn-2164","text":", no coalition runtime) — into a small lawful runtime, and make it authorable in the Forge as bricks you snap together. Each brick carries "},{"id":"spn-2165","marks":["italic"],"text":"invariant · laws · enforcement · feedback · adaptation"},{"id":"spn-2166","text":"; composing bricks yields another brick. The verdict is the arithmetic."}]}],"id":"blk-2101","kind":"quote"},{"id":"blk-2103","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-2167","text":"1. Why this, why now"}]},{"id":"blk-2104","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-2168","marks":["code"],"text":"UMBRELLA.md"},{"id":"spn-2169","text":" lists seven stages: "},{"id":"spn-2170","marks":["code"],"text":"declare → validate → compose → govern → wire → run → observe"},{"id":"spn-2171","text":". Every stage has a shipped engine "},{"id":"spn-2172","marks":["bold"],"text":"except `compose`"},{"id":"spn-2173","text":", which is marked "},{"id":"spn-2174","marks":["italic"],"text":"\"`&` ✅ · `|>` still lawless · cross-agent coalition compose ❌.\""},{"id":"spn-2175","text":" "},{"id":"spn-2176","marks":["code"],"text":"CC2-capability-composition.md"},{"id":"spn-2177","text":" already specifies the missing piece normatively ("},{"id":"spn-2178","marks":["code"],"text":"&"},{"id":"spn-2179","text":" lattice, "},{"id":"spn-2180","marks":["code"],"text":"|>"},{"id":"spn-2181","text":" governed monoid, the coalition object, rung-by-rung admissibility) — but it is "},{"id":"spn-2182","marks":["bold"],"text":"draft, no runtime"},{"id":"spn-2183","text":": schema + "},{"id":"spn-2184","marks":["code"],"text":"box-and-box lift"},{"id":"spn-2185","text":" exist, the compose runtime and lawful "},{"id":"spn-2186","marks":["code"],"text":"|>"},{"id":"spn-2187","text":" do not."}]},{"id":"blk-2105","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-2188","text":"So this is not a new language. It is the "},{"id":"spn-2189","marks":["bold"],"text":"runtime + authoring surface for a spec we already wrote."},{"id":"spn-2190","text":" The user's \"compose stacks like legos (invariant + laws + enforcement + feedback + adaptation)\" maps exactly onto CC2 compose."}]},{"id":"blk-2106","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-2191","text":"The five facets already have engines (nothing greenfield)"}]},{"head":[{"id":"blk-2108","spans":[{"id":"spn-2192","text":"facet"}]},{"id":"blk-2109","spans":[{"id":"spn-2193","text":"engine that provides it"}]},{"id":"blk-2110","spans":[{"id":"spn-2194","text":"symbol"}]}],"id":"blk-2107","kind":"table","rows":[[{"id":"blk-2111","spans":[{"id":"spn-2195","marks":["bold"],"text":"invariant"}]},{"id":"blk-2112","spans":[{"id":"spn-2196","text":"Weave cost certificate ("},{"id":"spn-2197","marks":["code"],"text":"classify"},{"id":"spn-2198","text":"/"},{"id":"spn-2199","marks":["code"],"text":"inferEAL"},{"id":"spn-2200","text":") + alethic "},{"id":"spn-2201","marks":["code"],"text":"consume"},{"id":"spn-2202","text":" → "},{"id":"spn-2203","marks":["code"],"text":"0̲"}]},{"id":"blk-2113","spans":[{"id":"spn-2204","text":"the floor"}]}],[{"id":"blk-2114","spans":[{"id":"spn-2205","marks":["bold"],"text":"laws"}]},{"id":"blk-2115","spans":[{"id":"spn-2206","marks":["code"],"text":"box-and-box"},{"id":"spn-2207","text":" 103 property-tested laws ("},{"id":"spn-2208","marks":["code"],"text":"test/laws.mjs"},{"id":"spn-2209","text":")"}]},{"id":"blk-2116","spans":[{"id":"spn-2210","text":"the algebra"}]}],[{"id":"blk-2117","spans":[{"id":"spn-2211","marks":["bold"],"text":"enforcement"}]},{"id":"blk-2118","spans":[{"id":"spn-2212","text":"the bridge "},{"id":"spn-2213","marks":["code"],"text":"select(...)"},{"id":"spn-2214","text":" — "},{"id":"spn-2215","marks":["code"],"text":"feasible ▸ permitted ▸ best"}]},{"id":"blk-2119","spans":[{"id":"spn-2216","text":"the verdict"}]}],[{"id":"blk-2120","spans":[{"id":"spn-2217","marks":["bold"],"text":"feedback"}]},{"id":"blk-2121","spans":[{"id":"spn-2218","marks":["code"],"text":"observe"},{"id":"spn-2219","text":" stage — "},{"id":"spn-2220","marks":["code"],"text":"evolution.mjs"},{"id":"spn-2221","text":" provenance hash-chain + PULSE bus"}]},{"id":"blk-2122","spans":[{"id":"spn-2222","text":"the trace"}]}],[{"id":"blk-2123","spans":[{"id":"spn-2223","marks":["bold"],"text":"adaptation"}]},{"id":"blk-2124","spans":[{"id":"spn-2224","marks":["code"],"text":"evolution.mjs"},{"id":"spn-2225","text":" "},{"id":"spn-2226","marks":["code"],"text":"evolve()"},{"id":"spn-2227","text":" — measured/priced/certified change (EV1–EV6)"}]},{"id":"blk-2125","spans":[{"id":"spn-2228","text":"the rewrite"}]}]]},{"id":"blk-2126","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-2229","marks":["bold"],"text":"Crucial finding (de-risks v1):"},{"id":"spn-2230","text":" "},{"id":"spn-2231","marks":["code"],"text":"value.mjs"},{"id":"spn-2232","text":" already exports the operators CC2 needs — "},{"id":"spn-2233","marks":["code"],"text":"combine(a,b)"},{"id":"spn-2234","text":" (the "},{"id":"spn-2235","marks":["code"],"text":"&"},{"id":"spn-2236","text":" lattice merge), "},{"id":"spn-2237","marks":["code"],"text":"chain(a,b)"},{"id":"spn-2238","text":" (the sequential, phase-graded "},{"id":"spn-2239","marks":["code"],"text":"|>"},{"id":"spn-2240","text":"), and "},{"id":"spn-2241","marks":["code"],"text":"consume(v,req)"},{"id":"spn-2242","text":" (the alethic gate that produces "},{"id":"spn-2243","marks":["code"],"text":"0̲"},{"id":"spn-2244","text":"). CC2's "},{"id":"spn-2245","marks":["code"],"text":"&"},{"id":"spn-2246","text":"/"},{"id":"spn-2247","marks":["code"],"text":"|>"},{"id":"spn-2248","text":" are these "},{"id":"spn-2249","marks":["italic"],"text":"lifted from raw Values to capabilities-with-holder-and-contract."},{"id":"spn-2250","text":" The hard algebra is done; v1 is a thin lift + a type-compatibility check + a surface."}]},{"id":"blk-2127","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-2251","text":"2. The brick (the unit of composition)"}]},{"id":"blk-2128","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-2252","text":"A "},{"id":"spn-2253","marks":["bold"],"text":"brick"},{"id":"spn-2254","text":" is a capability annotated with everything needed to compose it lawfully:"}]},{"id":"blk-2129","kind":"code","language":"text","text":"Brick = {\n  id, holder,                       // who provides it (CC2 provenance tag)\n  contract: { accepts_from, feeds_into },   // the |> hand-off types\n  value: V({ pi, beta, kappa, sigma }),     // alethic modal value (box-and-box)\n  cost:  WeaveCostCertificate,              // the invariant — see §2.1 (the atom this whole layer rests on)\n  utility,                                   // axiological score input\n  laws:  [...lawIds],                        // which rung laws it claims (conformance)\n  floor: [...forbidden],                     // un-weakenable deontic/reflexive constraints\n}"},{"id":"blk-2130","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-2255","text":"A brick is exactly the [&] "},{"id":"spn-2256","marks":["code"],"text":"CC1"},{"id":"spn-2257","text":" capability + holder (CC2 §2.1) + its Weave cost cert. The five facets are all present: cost = invariant, laws = laws, value/floor = enforcement inputs, and the brick gains feedback/adaptation when wrapped in a loop (§3, "},{"id":"spn-2258","marks":["code"],"text":"⟲"},{"id":"spn-2259","text":")."}]},{"id":"blk-2131","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-2260","text":"2.1 "},{"id":"spn-2261","marks":["code"],"text":"WeaveCostCertificate"},{"id":"spn-2262","text":" — the "},{"id":"spn-2263","marks":["code"],"text":"Brick.cost"},{"id":"spn-2264","text":" contract (build this FIRST)"}]},{"id":"blk-2132","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-2265","text":"The certificate is the atom; the compose runtime is the molecule. It must exist before any composition. Canonical, IR-hash-bound, "},{"id":"spn-2266","marks":["bold"],"text":"fail-closed"},{"id":"spn-2267","text":":"}]},{"id":"blk-2133","kind":"code","language":"ts","text":"type WeaveCostCertificate = {\n  subject:  { kind: \"weave-ir\"; hash: string };          // cert is BOUND to the IR hash;\n                                                          // any IR change invalidates it\n  analyzer: { name: \"weave-eal\" | \"weave-classify\" | \"weave-lal\"; version: string };\n  verdict:  {\n    certified:  boolean;       // did analysis succeed with a real bound?\n    total:      boolean;       // termination guaranteed\n    oracleFree: boolean;       // eal:true ⟹ reduces with no residual superposition\n    costClass:  \"poly\" | \"elementary\" | \"exponential\" | \"tower\" | \"unknown\";\n    ealDepth?:  number;        // certified elementary tower height (weave-eal)\n    polynomialDegree?: number; // measured today (weave-eal-degree); PROVEN once static LAL lands\n    rank?:      number;        // legacy STLC type-order proxy ONLY — not the certificate's class\n  };\n  policy:   { resourceDecision: \"allow\" | \"budget_check\" | \"escalate\" | \"annihilate\"; reason: string };\n  evidence: { source?: string; generatedAt: string; /* space for signer/signature later */ };\n};"},{"id":"blk-2134","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-2268","marks":["bold"],"text":"Canonical vocabulary (one set, no synonyms):"},{"id":"spn-2269","text":" "},{"id":"spn-2270","marks":["code"],"text":"costClass"},{"id":"spn-2271","text":", "},{"id":"spn-2272","marks":["code"],"text":"ealDepth"},{"id":"spn-2273","text":", "},{"id":"spn-2274","marks":["code"],"text":"polynomialDegree"},{"id":"spn-2275","text":", "},{"id":"spn-2276","marks":["code"],"text":"certified"},{"id":"spn-2277","text":", "},{"id":"spn-2278","marks":["code"],"text":"oracleFree"},{"id":"spn-2279","text":", "},{"id":"spn-2280","marks":["code"],"text":"total"},{"id":"spn-2281","text":". Keep "},{"id":"spn-2282","marks":["code"],"text":"rank"},{"id":"spn-2283","text":" "},{"id":"spn-2284","marks":["italic"],"text":"only"},{"id":"spn-2285","text":" for the older STLC proxy. ("},{"id":"spn-2286","marks":["code"],"text":"classify"},{"id":"spn-2287","text":" currently returns "},{"id":"spn-2288","marks":["code"],"text":"{rank, rung, terr}"},{"id":"spn-2289","text":"; the certificate maps "},{"id":"spn-2290","marks":["code"],"text":"rung → costClass"},{"id":"spn-2291","text":" and surfaces "},{"id":"spn-2292","marks":["code"],"text":"eal"},{"id":"spn-2293","text":"/"},{"id":"spn-2294","marks":["code"],"text":"depth"},{"id":"spn-2295","text":" from "},{"id":"spn-2296","marks":["code"],"text":"inferEAL"},{"id":"spn-2297","text":".)"}]},{"id":"blk-2135","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-2298","marks":["bold"],"text":"Fail-closed is the default."},{"id":"spn-2299","text":" Uncertified / non-total / non-oracle-free / analyzer-error ⇒ "},{"id":"spn-2300","marks":["code"],"text":"resourceDecision: \"annihilate\""},{"id":"spn-2301","text":" ("},{"id":"spn-2302","marks":["code"],"text":"0̲"},{"id":"spn-2303","text":"). "},{"id":"spn-2304","marks":["bold"],"text":"Uncertified is vetoed, not a low score"},{"id":"spn-2305","text":" — utility can never resurrect it (this is the whole point of the floor). An explicit "},{"id":"spn-2306","marks":["code"],"text":"mode: \"production\" | \"development\""},{"id":"spn-2307","text":" may downgrade "},{"id":"spn-2308","marks":["code"],"text":"unknown → warn/override"},{"id":"spn-2309","text":" in dev, but "},{"id":"spn-2310","marks":["bold"],"text":"production unknown → `0̲`"},{"id":"spn-2311","text":", always."}]},{"id":"blk-2136","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-2312","marks":["bold"],"text":"Resource-rung mapping"},{"id":"spn-2313","text":" (the "},{"id":"spn-2314","marks":["code"],"text":"policy.resourceDecision"},{"id":"spn-2315","text":"):"}]},{"head":[{"id":"blk-2138","spans":[{"id":"spn-2316","text":"static result"}]},{"id":"blk-2139","spans":[{"id":"spn-2317","text":"decision"}]}],"id":"blk-2137","kind":"table","rows":[[{"id":"blk-2140","spans":[{"id":"spn-2318","marks":["code"],"text":"poly"},{"id":"spn-2319","text":" / "},{"id":"spn-2320","marks":["code"],"text":"ealDepth ≤ 1"},{"id":"spn-2321","text":" with safe bounds"}]},{"id":"blk-2141","spans":[{"id":"spn-2322","marks":["code"],"text":"allow"}]}],[{"id":"blk-2142","spans":[{"id":"spn-2323","marks":["code"],"text":"elementary"},{"id":"spn-2324","text":" above the cheap rung"}]},{"id":"blk-2143","spans":[{"id":"spn-2325","marks":["code"],"text":"budget_check"},{"id":"spn-2326","text":" / "},{"id":"spn-2327","marks":["code"],"text":"escalate"}]}],[{"id":"blk-2144","spans":[{"id":"spn-2328","marks":["code"],"text":"exponential"},{"id":"spn-2329","text":" / "},{"id":"spn-2330","marks":["code"],"text":"tower"}]},{"id":"blk-2145","spans":[{"id":"spn-2331","marks":["code"],"text":"escalate"},{"id":"spn-2332","text":" / cheaper-plan route"}]}],[{"id":"blk-2146","spans":[{"id":"spn-2333","text":"uncertified / not total / not oracle-free / analyzer error"}]},{"id":"blk-2147","spans":[{"id":"spn-2334","marks":["code"],"text":"annihilate"},{"id":"spn-2335","text":" ("},{"id":"spn-2336","marks":["code"],"text":"0̲"},{"id":"spn-2337","text":")"}]}]]},{"id":"blk-2148","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-2338","text":"3. The connectors (the lego studs) — and their laws"}]},{"id":"blk-2149","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-2339","text":"Four operators. The first two are CC2 §2; the laws are "},{"id":"spn-2340","marks":["italic"],"text":"already"},{"id":"spn-2341","text":" the box-and-box value laws, lifted."}]},{"id":"blk-2150","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-2342","marks":["code"],"text":"&"},{"id":"spn-2343","text":" — combine (parallel) → "},{"id":"spn-2344","marks":["code"],"text":"combine"}]},{"id":"blk-2151","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-2345","text":"Merge the joint capability set. Lattice join, holder-tagged."}]},{"id":"blk-2152","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-2154","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-2346","marks":["bold"],"text":"Laws (CC2 §2.1):"},{"id":"spn-2347","text":" "},{"id":"spn-2348","marks":["code"],"text":"A&B == B&A"},{"id":"spn-2349","text":", "},{"id":"spn-2350","marks":["code"],"text":"(A&B)&C == A&(B&C)"},{"id":"spn-2351","text":", "},{"id":"spn-2352","marks":["code"],"text":"A&A == A"},{"id":"spn-2353","text":", "},{"id":"spn-2354","marks":["code"],"text":"A&none == A"},{"id":"spn-2355","text":"."}]}],"id":"blk-2153","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-2156","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-2356","marks":["bold"],"text":"Cost:"},{"id":"spn-2357","text":" resource rung "},{"id":"spn-2358","marks":["bold"],"text":"adds"},{"id":"spn-2359","text":" (two capabilities cost the sum); invariants "},{"id":"spn-2360","marks":["bold"],"text":"conjoin"},{"id":"spn-2361","text":" (κ must stay acyclic — a combine that creates a cycle is flagged "},{"id":"spn-2362","marks":["code"],"text":"deliberate"},{"id":"spn-2363","text":")."}]}],"id":"blk-2155","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-2157","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-2364","marks":["code"],"text":"|>"},{"id":"spn-2365","text":" — pipeline (sequence) → "},{"id":"spn-2366","marks":["code"],"text":"chain"}]},{"id":"blk-2158","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-2367","text":"Governed sequential composition. "},{"id":"spn-2368","marks":["bold"],"text":"The operator CC1 left lawless."}]},{"id":"blk-2159","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-2161","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-2369","marks":["bold"],"text":"Laws (CC2 §2.2):"},{"id":"spn-2370","text":" "},{"id":"spn-2371","marks":["code"],"text":"(X|>f)|>g == X|>(f|>g)"},{"id":"spn-2372","text":", "},{"id":"spn-2373","marks":["code"],"text":"X|>id == X"},{"id":"spn-2374","text":", "},{"id":"spn-2375","marks":["bold"],"text":"not"},{"id":"spn-2376","text":" commutative, "},{"id":"spn-2377","marks":["bold"],"text":"not"},{"id":"spn-2378","text":" idempotent."}]}],"id":"blk-2160","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-2163","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-2379","marks":["bold"],"text":"Feasibility:"},{"id":"spn-2380","text":" at each hand-off, producer "},{"id":"spn-2381","marks":["code"],"text":"feeds_into"},{"id":"spn-2382","text":" must match consumer "},{"id":"spn-2383","marks":["code"],"text":"accepts_from"},{"id":"spn-2384","text":", else the stage carries "},{"id":"spn-2385","marks":["code"],"text":"0̲"},{"id":"spn-2386","text":" and "},{"id":"spn-2387","marks":["bold"],"text":"annihilates the whole pipeline"},{"id":"spn-2388","text":" (alethic "},{"id":"spn-2389","marks":["code"],"text":"consume"},{"id":"spn-2390","text":"). A type-incompatible pipeline is not \"invalid\" — it "},{"id":"spn-2391","marks":["italic"],"text":"is"},{"id":"spn-2392","text":" the zero of the composition."}]}],"id":"blk-2162","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-2165","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-2393","marks":["bold"],"text":"Quantities (semiring):"},{"id":"spn-2394","text":" confidence = product, cost = sum, worst-case latency = max, composed end-to-end; compared against each step's "},{"id":"spn-2395","marks":["code"],"text":"requires"},{"id":"spn-2396","text":" (epistemic β-gate)."}]}],"id":"blk-2164","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-2166","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-2397","marks":["code"],"text":"⟲"},{"id":"spn-2398","text":" — loop (PULSE nest)"}]},{"id":"blk-2167","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-2399","text":"Wrap a brick (or a "},{"id":"spn-2400","marks":["code"],"text":"&"},{"id":"spn-2401","text":"/"},{"id":"spn-2402","marks":["code"],"text":"|>"},{"id":"spn-2403","text":" tree) in a "},{"id":"spn-2404","marks":["code"],"text":"retrieve → route → act → learn → consolidate"},{"id":"spn-2405","text":" cadence. This is what attaches "},{"id":"spn-2406","marks":["bold"],"text":"feedback"},{"id":"spn-2407","text":" (the "},{"id":"spn-2408","marks":["code"],"text":"learn"},{"id":"spn-2409","text":" phase → "},{"id":"spn-2410","marks":["code"],"text":"OutcomeSignal"},{"id":"spn-2411","text":"/"},{"id":"spn-2412","marks":["code"],"text":"ReputationUpdate"},{"id":"spn-2413","text":" on the PULSE bus) and "},{"id":"spn-2414","marks":["bold"],"text":"adaptation"},{"id":"spn-2415","text":" ("},{"id":"spn-2416","marks":["code"],"text":"consolidate"},{"id":"spn-2417","text":" → "},{"id":"spn-2418","marks":["code"],"text":"evolution.mjs evolve()"},{"id":"spn-2419","text":"). Output is a "},{"id":"spn-2420","marks":["code"],"text":"*.pulse.json"},{"id":"spn-2421","text":" manifest, generated for free."}]},{"id":"blk-2168","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-2422","marks":["code"],"text":"0̲"},{"id":"spn-2423","text":" — floor (implicit, on every operator)"}]},{"id":"blk-2169","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-2424","text":"Any sub-brick that violates an invariant or busts budget annihilates to "},{"id":"spn-2425","marks":["code"],"text":"0̲"},{"id":"spn-2426","text":" — it does "},{"id":"spn-2427","marks":["bold"],"text":"not"},{"id":"spn-2428","text":" down-rank the parent; it kills that branch (the same floor pattern Weave→govern already uses)."}]},{"id":"blk-2170","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-2429","marks":["bold"],"text":"Closure (why it's legos):"},{"id":"spn-2430","text":" the bridge is closed under composition — composing governed verdicts yields a governed verdict with a merged certificate. So a tree of bricks exposes the "},{"id":"spn-2431","marks":["italic"],"text":"same"},{"id":"spn-2432","text":" Brick interface and emits the "},{"id":"spn-2433","marks":["italic"],"text":"same"},{"id":"spn-2434","text":" six PULSE tokens. A brick of bricks is a brick."}]},{"id":"blk-2171","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-2435","text":"4. The composite certificate"}]},{"id":"blk-2172","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-2436","marks":["code"],"text":"compose(tree)"},{"id":"spn-2437","text":" returns one certificate for the whole assembly:"}]},{"id":"blk-2173","kind":"code","language":"text","text":"{ decision: <winning plan | 0̲>,\n  cost:  { rung: join(parts), ... },     // Weave: whole-tree cost class\n  value: V(...),                          // alethic: conjoined feasibility + κ\n  permitted: <bridge verdict>,            // box-and-box select(): feasible ▸ permitted ▸ best\n  annihilated: [...0̲ branches with σ tags],\n  record: <evolution.mjs hash-chain entry> }"},{"id":"blk-2174","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-2438","text":"This is \"the verdict is the arithmetic\": the composite verdict is "},{"id":"spn-2439","marks":["italic"],"text":"computed"},{"id":"spn-2440","text":", not heuristic — cost from Weave, permission from the bridge, both over the same structural floor."}]},{"id":"blk-2175","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-2441","text":"5. v1 scope"}]},{"id":"blk-2176","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-2442","text":"Ordered so each slice is independently shippable and the risky/broad part comes last. "},{"id":"spn-2443","marks":["bold"],"text":"Slice 0 is the narrow resource-rung path a second review (ChatGPT, on `weave-and-the-ampersand-stack.md`) recommends doing first and alone"},{"id":"spn-2444","text":" — it is correct, and it is also exactly "},{"id":"spn-2445","marks":["code"],"text":"Brick.cost"},{"id":"spn-2446","text":", so it serves both goals."}]},{"id":"blk-2177","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-2447","marks":["bold"],"text":"Slice 0 — the certificate (do this first, ships value on its own):"}]},{"id":"blk-2178","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-2180","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-2448","marks":["code"],"text":"weave/src/weave-certificate.mjs"},{"id":"spn-2449","text":" — given Weave IR, emit a deterministic "},{"id":"spn-2450","marks":["code"],"text":"WeaveCostCertificate"},{"id":"spn-2451","text":" (§2.1): IR hash, analyzer identity+version, "},{"id":"spn-2452","marks":["code"],"text":"costClass"},{"id":"spn-2453","text":"/"},{"id":"spn-2454","marks":["code"],"text":"ealDepth"},{"id":"spn-2455","text":"/"},{"id":"spn-2456","marks":["code"],"text":"polynomialDegree"},{"id":"spn-2457","text":", fail-closed "},{"id":"spn-2458","marks":["code"],"text":"resourceDecision"},{"id":"spn-2459","text":". Pure, no new runtime."}]}],"id":"blk-2179","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-2182","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-2460","text":"Tests ("},{"id":"spn-2461","marks":["code"],"text":"weave/test/"},{"id":"spn-2462","text":"): cheap/poly term → "},{"id":"spn-2463","marks":["code"],"text":"allow"},{"id":"spn-2464","text":"; expensive term → "},{"id":"spn-2465","marks":["code"],"text":"escalate"},{"id":"spn-2466","text":"; unknown/rejected term → "},{"id":"spn-2467","marks":["code"],"text":"annihilate"},{"id":"spn-2468","text":"; "},{"id":"spn-2469","marks":["bold"],"text":"hash changes when IR changes"},{"id":"spn-2470","text":" (binding test)."}]}],"id":"blk-2181","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-2184","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-2471","text":"Harden the "},{"id":"spn-2472","marks":["code"],"text":"surface/weave_govern.exs"},{"id":"spn-2473","text":" → "},{"id":"spn-2474","marks":["code"],"text":"box-and-box"},{"id":"spn-2475","text":" resource-rung path to consume the certificate (not re-parse strings), and assert "},{"id":"spn-2476","marks":["code"],"text":"0̲"},{"id":"spn-2477","text":" annihilation happens "},{"id":"spn-2478","marks":["italic"],"text":"before"},{"id":"spn-2479","text":" utility can resurrect an option. Update "},{"id":"spn-2480","marks":["code"],"text":"proofs/"},{"id":"spn-2481","text":" receipts: certified-cheap wins & runs · high-utility exponential annihilated · uncertified annihilated · refused plan run manually detonates."}]}],"id":"blk-2183","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":true},{"id":"blk-2185","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-2482","marks":["bold"],"text":"Slice 1+ — the compose runtime (the lego layer, on top of Slice 0):"}]},{"id":"blk-2186","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-2188","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-2483","marks":["code"],"text":"box-and-box/compose.mjs"},{"id":"spn-2484","text":" — "},{"id":"spn-2485","marks":["code"],"text":"composeAnd"},{"id":"spn-2486","text":", "},{"id":"spn-2487","marks":["code"],"text":"composePipe"},{"id":"spn-2488","text":", "},{"id":"spn-2489","marks":["code"],"text":"composeTree"},{"id":"spn-2490","text":", lifting "},{"id":"spn-2491","marks":["code"],"text":"combine"},{"id":"spn-2492","text":"/"},{"id":"spn-2493","marks":["code"],"text":"chain"},{"id":"spn-2494","text":"/"},{"id":"spn-2495","marks":["code"],"text":"consume"},{"id":"spn-2496","text":" from Values to Bricks, with the "},{"id":"spn-2497","marks":["code"],"text":"feeds_into"},{"id":"spn-2498","text":"/"},{"id":"spn-2499","marks":["code"],"text":"accepts_from"},{"id":"spn-2500","text":" check and semiring quantity composition."}]}],"id":"blk-2187","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-2190","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-2501","marks":["code"],"text":"test/compose-laws.mjs"},{"id":"spn-2502","text":" — CC2 §2 conformance (assoc/idem/identity for "},{"id":"spn-2503","marks":["code"],"text":"&"},{"id":"spn-2504","text":"; assoc/identity + infeasible⇒"},{"id":"spn-2505","marks":["code"],"text":"0̲"},{"id":"spn-2506","text":" for "},{"id":"spn-2507","marks":["code"],"text":"|>"},{"id":"spn-2508","text":"). Property-tested, same harness as the 103."}]}],"id":"blk-2189","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-2192","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-2509","text":"Forge surface: brick palette + canvas; snap with "},{"id":"spn-2510","marks":["code"],"text":"& | ⟲"},{"id":"spn-2511","text":"; the six panels retarget to the "},{"id":"spn-2512","marks":["italic"],"text":"selected composite"},{"id":"spn-2513","text":" (Certificate = whole-tree cost, Governance = bridge over the tree, Evolve = mutate the tree); "},{"id":"spn-2514","marks":["bold"],"text":"+ a Feedback panel"},{"id":"spn-2515","text":" ("},{"id":"spn-2516","marks":["code"],"text":"learn"},{"id":"spn-2517","text":"→"},{"id":"spn-2518","marks":["code"],"text":"OutcomeSignal"},{"id":"spn-2519","text":")."}]}],"id":"blk-2191","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-2194","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-2520","text":"A worked demo: a 3-brick coalition ("},{"id":"spn-2521","marks":["code"],"text":"retrieve |> certify |> govern"},{"id":"spn-2522","text":") composed, certified, governed, evolved — the [&] stack composing "},{"id":"spn-2523","marks":["italic"],"text":"itself"},{"id":"spn-2524","text":"."}]}],"id":"blk-2193","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":true,"start":4},{"id":"blk-2195","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-2525","marks":["bold"],"text":"Conservative composite-cost rule (CC2 §2.2; keep simple, don't overbuild):"},{"id":"spn-2526","text":" any uncertified child ⇒ the composed plan is uncertified ("},{"id":"spn-2527","marks":["code"],"text":"0̲"},{"id":"spn-2528","text":"); "},{"id":"spn-2529","marks":["code"],"text":"costClass"},{"id":"spn-2530","text":" = the max (worst) over children; numeric budgets "},{"id":"spn-2531","marks":["bold"],"text":"sum"},{"id":"spn-2532","text":" along "},{"id":"spn-2533","marks":["code"],"text":"|>"},{"id":"spn-2534","text":" (cost), "},{"id":"spn-2535","marks":["bold"],"text":"product"},{"id":"spn-2536","text":" for confidence, "},{"id":"spn-2537","marks":["bold"],"text":"max"},{"id":"spn-2538","text":" for latency. The certificate format must leave room for this — it does (§2.1) — but the multi-plan resolver itself is Slice 1, not Slice 0."}]},{"id":"blk-2196","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-2539","marks":["bold"],"text":"Out (v1):"}]},{"id":"blk-2197","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-2199","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-2540","text":"Cross-agent "},{"id":"spn-2541","marks":["bold"],"text":"strategic"},{"id":"spn-2542","text":" ability ("},{"id":"spn-2543","marks":["code"],"text":"⟨⟨agents⟩⟩◊ ensure"},{"id":"spn-2544","text":", CC2 §3) — coalition admissibility against an adversary. v2."}]}],"id":"blk-2198","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-2201","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-2545","text":"Common-knowledge / coordinated-attack epistemic check (CC2 §3). v2."}]}],"id":"blk-2200","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-2203","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-2546","text":"CloudEvents transport on the PULSE bus ("},{"id":"spn-2547","marks":["code"],"text":"UMBRELLA.md"},{"id":"spn-2548","text":" item 5). Keep the local hash-chain substrate; wire transport later."}]}],"id":"blk-2202","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-2205","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-2549","text":"A real interpositional "},{"id":"spn-2550","marks":["code"],"text":"run"},{"id":"spn-2551","text":" host. Out — that's a separate stage."}]}],"id":"blk-2204","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-2206","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-2552","marks":["bold"],"text":"Connects to, must not skip:"},{"id":"spn-2553","text":" the "},{"id":"spn-2554","marks":["code"],"text":"govern"},{"id":"spn-2555","text":" bridge ("},{"id":"spn-2556","marks":["code"],"text":"box-and-box compile"},{"id":"spn-2557","text":"/"},{"id":"spn-2558","marks":["code"],"text":"govern"},{"id":"spn-2559","text":") is the dependency; compose sits "},{"id":"spn-2560","marks":["italic"],"text":"on top"},{"id":"spn-2561","text":" of it. The first technical task is lawful "},{"id":"spn-2562","marks":["code"],"text":"|>"},{"id":"spn-2563","text":" (item 1) — small and self-contained."}]},{"id":"blk-2207","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-2564","text":"6. Review checklist (against CC2 before any code)"}]},{"id":"blk-2208","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-2210","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-2565","text":"[ ] Does "},{"id":"spn-2566","marks":["code"],"text":"Brick"},{"id":"spn-2567","text":" faithfully carry CC2 §2.1's holder + contract, and is "},{"id":"spn-2568","marks":["code"],"text":"&"},{"id":"spn-2569","text":" still idempotent with the holder tag as provenance (not a tiebreak)?"}]}],"id":"blk-2209","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-2212","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-2570","text":"[ ] Does "},{"id":"spn-2571","marks":["code"],"text":"|>"},{"id":"spn-2572","text":" match CC2 §2.2 exactly: associative, "},{"id":"spn-2573","marks":["code"],"text":"id"},{"id":"spn-2574","text":" identity, non-commutative, infeasible⇒"},{"id":"spn-2575","marks":["code"],"text":"0̲"},{"id":"spn-2576","text":", semiring quantities?"}]}],"id":"blk-2211","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-2214","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-2577","text":"[ ] Is the composite cost the "},{"id":"spn-2578","marks":["bold"],"text":"join"},{"id":"spn-2579","text":" of parts' Weave rungs (not a re-measurement)?"}]}],"id":"blk-2213","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-2216","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-2580","text":"[ ] Are the new laws a strict superset check over the existing 103 (no contradiction with "},{"id":"spn-2581","marks":["code"],"text":"combine"},{"id":"spn-2582","text":"/"},{"id":"spn-2583","marks":["code"],"text":"chain"},{"id":"spn-2584","text":"/"},{"id":"spn-2585","marks":["code"],"text":"consume"},{"id":"spn-2586","text":" laws)?"}]}],"id":"blk-2215","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-2218","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-2587","text":"[ ] Is v1 honest about what it is "},{"id":"spn-2588","marks":["italic"],"text":"not"},{"id":"spn-2589","text":" (no strategic/epistemic coalition admissibility yet)?"}]}],"id":"blk-2217","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-2219","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-2590","text":"7. What this ships for the stack"}]},{"id":"blk-2220","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-2591","text":"It closes the "},{"id":"spn-2592","marks":["code"],"text":"compose"},{"id":"spn-2593","text":" stage — the last lawless stage of the umbrella — at the runtime+surface level, advancing "},{"id":"spn-2594","marks":["code"],"text":"UMBRELLA.md"},{"id":"spn-2595","text":" \"what done looks like\" items 3 ("},{"id":"spn-2596","marks":["code"],"text":"|>"},{"id":"spn-2597","text":" carries laws/holders/annihilation) and partway 4. It turns the Forge from a λ-term playground into the "},{"id":"spn-2598","marks":["bold"],"text":"authoring surface for CC2 coalitions"},{"id":"spn-2599","text":", where the demo composes the portfolio's own engines. And it does so as a "},{"id":"spn-2600","marks":["italic"],"text":"thin lift"},{"id":"spn-2601","text":" over already-shipped, already-property-tested algebra — not a new language."}]}],"edges":[],"id":"bagaaierasnglgp3vp67ftsiqskf4cn7rrgrecvs3cfjohd3p55k4vcizncna","vocabulary":"ampersand.docs.fs.v1"}